{"id":"f3ea86a3630afb2d","group":"56","path":"56/56-cor-needed-fair-normalization.md","title":"必需步与公平正规化接口补记","display":"cor-needed-fair-normalization — 必需步与公平正规化接口补记","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-cor-needed-fair-normalization","aliases":["56-cor-needed-fair-normalization"],"display":"cor-needed-fair-normalization — 必需步与公平正规化接口补记","depends_on":["[[56-thm-needed-hyper-normalizing]]","[[56-thm-outermost-fair-normalizing]]"],"reconstructed":"2026-10-19","reconstruction_basis":"supplied-book-56-files","historical_record_status":"original-record-not-supplied"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-cor-needed-fair-normalization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-cor-needed-fair-normalization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-needed-fair-normalization — 必需步与公平正规化接口补记"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"58edeb4b336cf785\" href=\"?note=58edeb4b336cf785\" title=\"56-thm-needed-hyper-normalizing\">56-thm-needed-hyper-normalizing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"730b198c9636b875\" href=\"?note=730b198c9636b875\" title=\"56-thm-outermost-fair-normalizing\">56-thm-outermost-fair-normalizing</a></span></div>"},{"key":"reconstructed","html":"2026-10-19"},{"key":"reconstruction_basis","html":"supplied-book-56-files"},{"key":"historical_record_status","html":"original-record-not-supplied"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定正交项重写系统 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 及其项集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WNAt}\">\\(\\operatorname{WNAt}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_R\">\\(\\mathcal E_R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Step}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{Step}_R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{InfHyperNeeded}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{InfHyperNeeded}_R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HyperNormalizingNeeded}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{HyperNormalizingNeeded}_R\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"58edeb4b336cf785\" href=\"?note=58edeb4b336cf785\" title=\"56-thm-needed-hyper-normalizing\">56-thm-needed-hyper-normalizing</a> 及其上游；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OuterFairPath}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{OuterFairPath}_R\\)</span>、两种公平策略谓词及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NormalizingOccStrategy}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{NormalizingOccStrategy}_R\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"730b198c9636b875\" href=\"?note=730b198c9636b875\" title=\"56-thm-outermost-fair-normalizing\">56-thm-outermost-fair-normalizing</a> 及其上游。所有无限序列与策略参数均在各自公式中局部量化；系统本身不预设存在无限归约。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\boldsymbol s\\in T^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\forall\\boldsymbol u\\in\\mathcal E_R^{\\mathbb N}\\;\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{WNAt}(T,\\to_R,s_0)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\neg\\operatorname{InfHyperNeeded}_R(\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol u)\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\boldsymbol s\\in T^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\forall\\boldsymbol u\\in\\mathcal E_R^{\\mathbb N}\\;\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{WNAt}(T,\\to_R,s_0)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\neg\\operatorname{InfHyperNeeded}_R(\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol u)\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HyperNormalizingNeeded}_R.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HyperNormalizingNeeded}_R.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\boldsymbol s\\in T^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\forall\\boldsymbol u\\in\\mathcal E_R^{\\mathbb N}\\;\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{WNAt}(T,\\to_R,s_0)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\neg\\operatorname{OuterFairPath}_R(\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol u)\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\boldsymbol s\\in T^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\forall\\boldsymbol u\\in\\mathcal E_R^{\\mathbb N}\\;\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{WNAt}(T,\\to_R,s_0)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\neg\\operatorname{OuterFairPath}_R(\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol u)\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall S\\subseteq\\operatorname{Step}_R\\;\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{OuterFairOccStrategy}_R(S)\\lor\\operatorname{FairOccStrategy}_R(S)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{NormalizingOccStrategy}_R(S)\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall S\\subseteq\\operatorname{Step}_R\\;\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{OuterFairOccStrategy}_R(S)\\lor\\operatorname{FairOccStrategy}_R(S)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{NormalizingOccStrategy}_R(S)\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节点保留输入修订补记中已给出的数学断言，并依其数学内容规范名称及类型。原文件的历史重建信息仍记录在元数据中；数学含义由前两段和所列第 56 本内部依赖确定。</p>\n<p>这里复原的是原导航已指明的 needed → hyper-normalization → outermost-fair 正规化接口。结论针对可达正规形的起点及相应策略，不增加全系统终止、共尾性或头正规化的断言。SR 投影与良基下降的中间定义、假设和结论仍由所列定理的内部依赖提供。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-thm-needed-hyper-no